    <ol>
      <li><strong>Top app bar</strong> — spans the full width, above both columns.</li>
      <li><strong>Rail column (desktop)</strong> — fixed 80px, separated by a 1px right border, never a shadow.</li>
      <li><strong>Rail items</strong> — stacked icon-over-label; the selected one is accent-colored only (no pill — the M2 2020 rail style).</li>
      <li><strong>Content</strong> — the only scrolling area; capped by <code>--fl-content-max</code>.</li>
    </ol>
    <p>On phones the rail column disappears and items 2–3 render as a normal
       bottom tab bar — same element, same classes.</p>
