<section class="docs-section">
  <h2 id="i-theming">Theming</h2>
  <p>Everything is a CSS custom property on <code>:root</code> — override inline
     or in your own stylesheet, no rebuild:</p>
  <table class="docs-table">
    <thead>
      <tr><th>Token</th><th>Affects</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td><code>--fl-accent</code></td><td>Selected rail item tint (icon + label)</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>--fl-border</code></td><td>Rail's 1px right border</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>--fl-topbar-h</code></td><td>Top bar height</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>--fl-tabbar-h</code></td><td>Bottom bar height on phones</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>--fl-content-max</code></td><td>Max content column width on desktop</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <p>The rail width (80px) is hard-coded in the desktop grid override — it is
     part of the component's proportions, not a token. If you need a different
     width, override <code>.fl-shell-rail</code>'s grid and the tab padding.</p>
  {% set themeExample %}
:root {
  --fl-accent: #188038;
}
{% endset %}
  {{ snippet(themeExample) }}
</section>
{% endset %}

